.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH MIRNA 1 2000-1月 "psRNATarget" "psRNATarget"
.SH NAME
psRNATarget \- create the psRNATarget algorithm object for predict the miRNA target site
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIpsRNATarget(\fBversion\fR as <integer> Schema = [V2_2017], 
\fBmax_expectation\fR as double = 5);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
create the psRNATarget algorithm object for predict the miRNA target site
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBversion\fB \fR\- 
 the schema version of the psRNATarget algorithm: the \fBV1_2011\fR schema uses 
 the seed region of the 2-8nt site of the miRNA sequence, and the 
 \fBV2_2017\fR schema(the default) uses the seed region of the 2-13nt site.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmax_expectation\fB \fR\- 
 the maximum expectation value cutoff of the target site match: the candidate 
 match result that its position weighted expectation value is greater than 
 this cutoff will be ignored(the expectation value is the lower the better).
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SequenceAlignment.siRNAHit.psRNATarget\fR algorithm object, which implements the 
 @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SequenceAlignment.siRNAHit.miRNAMapper\fR interface, so that it can be used by the 
 \fBmiRNA_targets\fR api for run the target site match.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
miRNA
.SH FILES
.PP
TRNtoolkit.dll
.PP
